ntricular dysfunction due to pulmonary vascular/lung disease and is not a usual manifestation of infective endocarditis; stroke, hematuria and splenomegaly may occur.","E":"Cor pulmonale reflects right ventricular dysfunction due to pulmonary vascular/lung disease and is not a usual manifestation of infective endocarditis; stroke, hematuria and splenomegaly may occur."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"f4a47eb9ff52262f6b2a241b55c7407d81c52eca94d4529486dc912628333564"},"q-4a604026271a":{"correct":"C","answerText":"Gender, religion, ethnic group","explanation":"Gender, religion and ethnic group are categorical variables; age, height and income are typically recorded quantitatively.","optionReasons":{"A":"Age, temperature, income, height — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Gender, religion and ethnic group are categorical variables; age, height and income are typically recorded quantitatively.","B":"Grade point average, anxiety level, reading performance — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Gender, religion and ethnic group are categorical variables; age, height and income are typically recorded quantitatively.","C":"Gender, religion and ethnic group are categorical variables; age, height and income are typically recorded quantitatively.","D":"Both a and b — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Gender, religion and ethnic group are categorical variables; age, height and income are typically recorded quantitatively."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"6d338c3db7c5b9e18b494e51d2f3d23832e4e2870637c02d8697e70649382406"},"q-913e29d903aa":{"correct":"C","answerText":"Elevated ASO titers","explanation":"Antistreptolysin-O antibodies rise after group A strep