d speech, racing thoughts, irritable or elevated mood and increased activity are characteristic of a manic episode of bipolar disorder.","E":"Pressured speech, racing thoughts, irritable or elevated mood and increased activity are characteristic of a manic episode of bipolar disorder."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"75cd4305e060e7da561fec7973a7cf1f4a24e1af23d9cedbe4b07e7f5fa33183"},"q-970920564736":{"correct":"A","answerText":"Pilocarpine","explanation":"Pilocarpine stimulates muscarinic receptors in the eye and can lower intraocular pressure by increasing trabecular outflow through ciliary-muscle contraction.","optionReasons":{"A":"Pilocarpine stimulates muscarinic receptors in the eye and can lower intraocular pressure by increasing trabecular outflow through ciliary-muscle contraction.","B":"Lobeline — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Pilocarpine stimulates muscarinic receptors in the eye and can lower intraocular pressure by increasing trabecular outflow through ciliary-muscle contraction.","C":"Acethylcholine — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Pilocarpine stimulates muscarinic receptors in the eye and can lower intraocular pressure by increasing trabecular outflow through ciliary-muscle contraction.","D":"Neostigmine — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Pilocarpine stimulates muscarinic receptors in the eye and can lower intraocular pressure by increasing trabecular outflow through ciliary-muscle contraction."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"28f47d618f399f3c463e56165763d8e5d7aee3a823d1a8f795f9436ca3841935"},"q-f43fa12414bb":{"correct":"B","answerText":"Acute Tubular Necrosis","explanation":"Low cardiac output and renal hypoperfusio