ess dependent on hepatic function than amide agents.","C":"Procaine is an ester local anesthetic rapidly hydrolyzed by plasma cholinesterases, so its metabolism is less dependent on hepatic function than amide agents.","D":"Etidocaine — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Procaine is an ester local anesthetic rapidly hydrolyzed by plasma cholinesterases, so its metabolism is less dependent on hepatic function than amide agents."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"a5ceb914a44fbdad70d536c3a06973750cdd7bfda93331f8ce289679332bfe86"},"q-e5638453c972":{"correct":"D","answerText":"Convenience sampling","explanation":"Convenience sampling recruits participants who are readily accessible or willing to participate and is not a probability method.","optionReasons":{"A":"Simple random sampling — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Convenience sampling recruits participants who are readily accessible or willing to participate and is not a probability method.","B":"Cluster sampling — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Convenience sampling recruits participants who are readily accessible or willing to participate and is not a probability method.","C":"Systematic sampling — Not the best choice for the stated question. Distinguishing fact: Convenience sampling recruits participants who are readily accessible or willing to participate and is not a probability method.","D":"Convenience sampling recruits participants who are readily accessible or willing to participate and is not a probability method."},"references":[],"review":"independently_reasoned_batch3_provisional_no_original_key","reviewDate":"2026-10-19","provisional":true,"questionTextHash":"2ab74cb0956e52bfa02c426120adda1ed067626fc714aab880f61e89e1537684"},"q-c77c1a6958d1":{"correct":"C","answerText":"Intramuscular","expla